fixture z1_07_control_late_dash
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 7; control for z1_07_coyote_dash: the first dash pressed on tick 101, the tick after the 6 coyote ticks, is the air dash
room zone1/07_coyote_dash
spawn 74 864
frames 170
input
  0..57 R
  58 R dash
  59..100 R
  # Ash walked off the ledge during tick 94 and her 6 coyote ticks are 95 to 100: on 101 the coyote
  # time is over, so this dash is the air dash. There is no second one and the air jump alone falls short.
  101 R dash
  102..125 R
  126..169 R jump
end
expect
  at 101 event.dash=1 state=dash air_frames=7 air_dashes=0
  mark pit 102..169 event.hazard=1
  never 0..169 event.room=1
end
